{"articleNo":"116860","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=116860&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014년 국가근로 동계방학 집중프로그램 희망근로기관 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.11.04","hit":"5092","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2014년 2학기 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\"><strong>동계방학중 교외근로를 신청한&nbsp;학생</strong></font>은 <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">접수기한내 학생희망근로기관을 신청</font></strong> 하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">학생신청 접수</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> '14.11.03(월) 09:00&nbsp;~ 11.7(금) 18:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">ㅇ&nbsp;신청방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">&nbsp;&